#. module: liber_copyright_contracts_support
#: model:mail.template,body_html:liber_copyright_contracts_support.mail_template_mission_statement
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n"
"    <p>Dear <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name\"/>,</p>\n"
"    <p>Please find attached your royalty statement for <t t-out=\"ctx.get('edlab_period_label', '')\"/>, covering: <t t-out=\"ctx.get('edlab_works', '')\"/>.</p>\n"
"    <p>Amount payable: <strong><t t-out=\"ctx.get('edlab_net_label', '')\"/></strong>.</p>\n"
"    <p>If anything looks wrong, just reply to this e-mail: your answer reaches the person handling your statement.</p>\n"
"    <p>Kind regards,<br/><t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/></p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "
msgstr "<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n    <p>Prezado(a) <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name\"/>,</p>\n    <p>Segue anexa a sua prestação de contas de direitos autorais do período <t t-out=\"ctx.get('edlab_period_label', '')\"/>, referente a: <t t-out=\"ctx.get('edlab_works', '')\"/>.</p>\n    <p>Valor a receber: <strong><t t-out=\"ctx.get('edlab_net_label', '')\"/></strong>.</p>\n    <p>Se algo parecer errado, basta responder a este e-mail: a sua resposta chega a quem cuida da sua prestação de contas.</p>\n    <p>Atenciosamente,<br/><t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/></p>\n</div>\n            "

#. module: liber_copyright_contracts_support
#: model:mail.template,body_html:liber_copyright_contracts_support.mail_template_mission_registration
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n"
"    <p>Dear <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name\"/>,</p>\n"
"    <p>To keep your royalty payments and statements in order, please reply to this e-mail with your current address, e-mail, bank details (or Pix key) and identification documents.</p>\n"
"    <p>Works under contract: <t t-out=\"ctx.get('edlab_works', '')\"/>.</p>\n"
"    <p>Kind regards,<br/><t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/></p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "
msgstr "<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n    <p>Prezado(a) <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name\"/>,</p>\n    <p>Para manter em dia os seus pagamentos e prestações de contas de direitos autorais, responda a este e-mail com o seu endereço atual, e-mail, dados bancários (ou chave Pix) e documentos de identificação.</p>\n    <p>Obras sob contrato: <t t-out=\"ctx.get('edlab_works', '')\"/>.</p>\n    <p>Atenciosamente,<br/><t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/></p>\n</div>\n            "

#. module: liber_copyright_contracts_support
#: model:mail.template,body_html:liber_copyright_contracts_support.mail_template_mission_settlement
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n"
"    <p>Dear <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name\"/>,</p>\n"
"    <p>We are settling the royalties of <t t-out=\"ctx.get('edlab_works', '')\"/> (contract(s) <t t-out=\"ctx.get('edlab_contracts', '')\"/>).</p>\n"
"    <p>Please confirm your bank details and reply to this e-mail with any question: your answer reaches the person handling your settlement.</p>\n"
"    <p>Kind regards,<br/><t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/></p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "
msgstr "<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n    <p>Prezado(a) <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name\"/>,</p>\n    <p>Estamos fazendo o acerto dos direitos autorais de <t t-out=\"ctx.get('edlab_works', '')\"/> (contrato(s) <t t-out=\"ctx.get('edlab_contracts', '')\"/>).</p>\n    <p>Confirme os seus dados bancários e responda a este e-mail com qualquer dúvida: a sua resposta chega a quem cuida do seu acerto.</p>\n    <p>Atenciosamente,<br/><t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/></p>\n</div>\n            "

